# Task

Write the updated story summary now by merging the Previous Story Summary, when present, with the Story To Summarize. Use the Story Opening only as the starting point when no Previous Story Summary is present.

# Rules

Keep the summary in chronological order and in the same language as the story. Preserve the people involved, their relationships, the locations, the important events and decisions in order, promises and unresolved threads, and the situation at the end of the Story To Summarize. Drop atmosphere, repeated detail, and minor wording. Keep the summary concise and do not let it grow with every merge: compress older events further while keeping what later story depends on. Do not refer to the summary, segments, or the act of summarizing.

# Output

Return only the updated summary as plain text, with no headings, Markdown, labels, or any other text before or after it.
